        "summary": "Yale’s provided sources include statements indicating institutional support for AI adoption and risk management, including a commitment to safety, security, and academic integrity, and references to procurement coordination to minimize institutional risk. The Poorvu Center student guidance also describes a university investment in AI, but the provided sources do not set out a single consolidated governance framework beyond these statements and linked resources.",
