        "summary": "USC indicates that whether generative AI is permitted for coursework and assignments is determined by the instructor (including the ability to encourage, permit for specific assignments, or prohibit entirely), and instructors are encouraged to set expectations in the syllabus. Separately, USC states that representing AI-authored material as a student’s own work is considered plagiarism.",
