        "summary": "MSU defers decisions about student use of generative AI for graded coursework to the instructor via course-specific guidance. Students are only permitted to use generative AI to support coursework when explicitly permitted by the instructor, and if guidance is not provided, students are expected to consult the instructor before using AI for assignments. MSU also identifies fabrication, falsification, misrepresentation, impersonation, or creating deceptive content as non-permissible uses (with limited controlled exceptions).",
