        "summary": "For student coursework and other assignments, UGA’s academic honesty guidance frames AI use as unauthorized assistance unless an instructor explicitly authorizes it in advance. UGA also encourages instructors to clearly state acceptable and unacceptable AI uses in syllabi and assignment statements (allowing, limiting, or prohibiting AI use at the course level).",
