        "evidence": "As such, the use of generative AI in theses and dissertations is considered unauthorized assistance per the Academic Code of Honesty and is prohibited unless specifically authorized by members of the advisory committee for use within the approved scope. If approved by the advisory committee, the extent of generative AI usage should be disclosed in a statement within the thesis or dissertation.\n\nUsers are accountable for their work, irrespective of the AI tools used. This includes verifying the accuracy of information generated by AI and ensuring it is free from errors and biases.",
