        "summary": "AI use in coursework and other academic work is primarily at instructor discretion. Faculty may permit, prohibit, or partially allow generative AI, and they are expected to communicate the permitted/partial/prohibited uses in assignment descriptions and course syllabi before academic work begins. If AI use is prohibited by the faculty member, using it is treated as an unauthorized act and a violation of the Student Code of Conduct.",
