        "summary": "Stevens’ AI guidance requires human review of generative AI outputs and states that new AI uses in an employee’s work should receive prior approval from a supervisor and/or department chair. It also states that certain use cases (including grading or assessment of student work) require additional review and consideration prior to use in AI.",
