        "evidence": "Additionally, faculty should offer, and students should defer to, guidelines about appropriate use of AI in coursework, or when such use is prohibited. Students should also be aware of the appropriate and authorized use of AI in each class as outlined by the instructor and in accordance with the University Academic Integrity Policies.\n\nTo help protect your and Boston College’s interests, always consult with ITS and follow the University Technology Acquisition (bc.edu/gettech) process before using or acquiring new AI tools for University business. Remember that all use of AI tools must comply with applicable Boston College policies and procedures.",
