        "summary": "CWRU provides guidance resources encouraging responsible, critical use of AI tools and emphasizing human judgment and careful review of AI-generated content. UCITE and the Provost’s AI in Education resources position AI as an assistive teaching and learning technology and encourage faculty to reflect on how assistive GenAI tools can improve student learning, noting this may differ by faculty member and by department/program.",
