        "evidence": "There are varied ways artificial intelligence tools can be used in academic work. For students, the most important question to ask in a course context is “what has my instructor said about the ways AI tools can be used in this class or assignment?” Expectations and opportunities will differ from class to class, as each set of assignments is carefully designed toward particular learning goals.  Students should talk with their instructors, pay attention to policies on the syllabus, and note how assignment instructions reference technology use.\n\nUse of AI in developing self-study and self-assessment tools distinct from graded assessments is permitted",
