        "domain": "Institutional & Administrative",
        "summary": "UVM states that a dedicated AI team is leading broad AI efforts across the university, including AI governance and strategy, and that over 40 people are engaged in the AI taskforce to ensure a university-wide and thoughtful approach. UVM also notes that its researcher AI guideline page will be continually updated as AI policies and guidelines are adopted.",
        "evidence": "The following folks are helping lead broad AI efforts across the university, including efforts around AI governance, strategy, workforce development, and more. The university has over 40 folks from across the university engaged in the AI taskforce to ensure a university-wide and thoughtful approach.\n\nNotice: This page will be continually updated as AI policies and guidelines for researchers and research staff are adopted.",
