        "evidence": "When it comes to using generative AI in this course, the rule of thumb is to treat it as if it were a human. In general, you may use generative AI to do anything you are allowed to do with another person, and things you are prohibited from doing with another person cannot be done with generative AI either.\n* Only for non-graded assignments – this means that AI will not be used to generate content for graded assignments.\n\"Unlike any other course you may have had, the expectation in this class is that you use Gen AI tools as much as possible. “Cheating,” in this class, may constitute not using enough Gen AI in your work. Please be sure to include your own actual observations and reflections in your self-reflection submissions, though you are also encouraged to use Gen AI to enhance those as well.\"",
