        "summary": "UT San Antonio requires research transparency and accuracy review when AI is used in manuscripts or grant applications, and it warns that sponsor rules may prohibit such use. It also states that researchers should check sponsoring-agency policies for peer review work and notes confidentiality-based prohibitions in that context.",
