        "evidence": "1. Information you enter into Generative AI systems could be subject to a Public Records Act (PRA) request, may be viewable and usable by the company, and may be leaked unencrypted in a data breach. Do not submit any information to a Generative AI platform that should not be available to the general public (such as confidential, personally identifiable information, or FERPA-protected).",
