        "summary": "The university provides optional course-level language allowing AI for brainstorming, information gathering, outlining, grammar, and style support, but this is not a uniform student rule and is left to instructor choice. The College of Law default rule likewise permits AI for research and grammar correction, and instructors may deviate from that default in writing.",
