        "evidence": "Academic dishonesty will not be tolerated.\nProperly documenting and citing AI tool usage is mandatory to comply with university policies and any unauthorized use of generative AI tools in assignments may be considered academic dishonesty.\nThe purpose of the policy is to outline the procedures that allow graduate students to appeal an adverse decision by their college procedures of an instance of academic dishonesty.",
