        "domain": "Institutional & Administrative",
        "summary": "Faculty are expected to communicate explicitly what AI use is authorized in assignments and examinations. The university also provides optional syllabus language for instructors to adapt to their teaching context, and its AI task force includes work on training and best practices for faculty and staff across teaching, research, clinical practice, and administrative operations.",
