        "summary": "Use of AI in coursework is at instructor discretion rather than governed by a single university-wide permission rule. The university states that faculty should communicate whether AI use is permitted, restricted, or prohibited in their classes, and students are expected to follow those course-specific expectations. Undisclosed or unauthorized AI use can fall under academic dishonesty when it misrepresents another source's work as the student's own.",
