        "evidence": "Communicate and reiterate your expectations regarding academic integrity throughout the semester. For example, include an academic honesty statement for every assignment and exam.\nAs part of the University’s ongoing efforts to prevent cheating, and based on evidence of increased use of headphones and ear piece devices to permit cheating on exams, all students are required to display their ears for the duration of any exam. The policy may require adjustment to hair or clothing. Any student not complying with this policy will, after a warning, be issued a zero on the exam.",
