        "summary": "Fordham requires transparency about AI use when it materially contributes to academic, scholarly, or professional work, and students must follow instructor directions about whether and how AI use should be acknowledged. The academic integrity materials also require students to note assistance received from software programs or other outside sources. In addition, the AI guidance states that all AI-assisted work must be reviewed and edited by the submitting person.",
