        "summary": "Fordham has an institutional AI governance and strategy framework centered on mission-aligned, responsible adoption, and it has articulated this through a formal university AI policy and an AI Visioning Committee's recommendations. The recommendations describe a coordinated approach that includes research on appropriate uses, clear communication standards, faculty development, and structures for ongoing innovation and oversight. The university also emphasizes that AI use should be guided by Jesuit values, ethics, privacy, human judgment, and existing university policies.",
