        "summary": "The university does not set a blanket rule for AI use on exams; it is at the discretion of the individual instructor. Course syllabi and exam instructions should state whether AI use is permitted.",
        "evidence": "Can students use AI on Take-Home Exams? This is up to the individual instructor and should be stated in the instructions for the exam. Instructors should address this in their syllabi and/or on an assignment-by-assignment basis.",
