        "evidence": "Although instructors are not expected to use AI in their courses, those who choose to do so can contact the CTE for guidance using our Service Request Form.\n\nAI can assist in generating learning objectives, instructional activities, and syllabi. However, it is essential to incorporate human oversight and judgment, especially when professional schools, departments, or external certifications mandate specific standards and objectives. As the instructor, your expertise is crucial in aligning AI-generated materials with external requirements while considering the unique needs of your students and the context of your course.",
