        "summary": "USD does not have a university-wide license for generative AI detection software and does not endorse using these tools for academic dishonesty cases, citing their unreliability. Students are offered Turnitin Draft Coach for self-checking similarity. In the law school, failure to disclose AI use is treated as plagiarism. The research guidance notes that federal agencies may use detection tools.",
