        "evidence": "How are YOU using generative AI in your teaching? Are you using it to help you write your syllabus or assignment prompts? Are you using it to help you grade? We recommend being transparent with students about your own use of GenAI.\nThe CEE (Center for Educational Excellence) has also put together a resource for faculty about generative AI that includes...Assignment and assessment design ideas to encourage academic integrity.\nWhen using generative AI for your professional work, it is important to be mindful of...Data security and privacy...Copyright.",
