        "evidence": "Examples of violations of academic integrity include... Claiming credit for the ideas, words, or work of another person or source, including artificial intelligence, in whole or in part, without proper attribution. ... The information below includes sample citations for ChatGPT, but you can adapt these examples for other generative AI tools. These examples are based on the guidance currently available on the APA, MLA, and Chicago style websites.... APA Style Example: OpenAI. (2023). ChatGPT (Mar 14 version) [Large language model]. https://chat.openai.com/chat",
