        "summary": "For the Graduate School of Theology, AI use in assignments is governed by faculty instructions at the course level. GST faculty may prohibit AI for any part of assignments and student work, and the GST specifically prohibits using AI to generate outlines, write essays and responses, revise written work, replace assigned readings with AI summaries or evaluations, translate language assignments, or submit AI-generated work as one’s own. Outside GST, ACU’s general academic integrity materials require students to submit their own work.",
