        "summary": "For exams and quizzes, AI use is prohibited unless the instructor or course faculty specifically authorizes it. The PA manual also applies academic integrity standards to online exams and prohibits unauthorized external aids in examinations. Graduate nursing states that academic dishonesty on exams involving AI can result in a zero and dismissal from the program.",
