        "summary": "Graduate nursing states that the academic misconduct policy still applies to generative AI and that misuse affecting research is not tolerated. It also lists misconduct in research assignments among intolerable forms of academic misconduct. No separate IRB, grant, or ethics-form AI policy is defined in the provided documents.",
