        "summary": "The general AI policy applies to faculty, staff, officers, board members, contractors, affiliates, agents, and others acting on behalf of the university. New AI systems generally require approval by the AI Steering Committee and/or CIO, users must have subject-matter expertise, AI output must be thoroughly reviewed, department heads should be consulted and informed, and permission should be sought for certain tasks such as performance evaluations.",
