        "summary": "The university permits embedded AI tools within already approved software, but new AI systems must be approved. It prohibits putting non-public university information into open AI systems, prohibits entering trade secrets, confidential information, personal data, or any sensitive information into prohibited contexts, requires informed consent before inputting personal information into a closed AI system, and requires legal and internal review of AI systems and their terms of use.",
