        "evidence": "Academic Integrity: Students' use of AI tools must adhere to college requirements regarding academic integrity found in college policies, handbooks, codes of conduct, and other such documents.\nAmarillo College Student Rights and Responsibilities publication contains policies, regulations and procedures that include a Code of Conduct, and Alcohol and Drug policies. Students are responsible for knowing and abiding by its provisions. Failure to comply with these regulations may result in disciplinary action.",
