        "summary": "In the MA in Couple and Family Therapy program, AI may be used to support academic work, but submitted work must remain the student's own original work. Direct copying of AI-generated content without attribution is treated as plagiarism, and misuse can lead to academic sanctions under the program's academic integrity policy.",
