        "summary": "Aquinas requires staff and faculty software purchases for on-campus use to go through ITS approval and review, including review of any confidential data shared with third parties. Only ITS-approved software may be installed on managed Aquinas devices, and faculty, staff, and students may not install unapproved software without consulting ITS. The sources do not identify any AI-specific approved platform list.",
