        "summary": "ATU requires transparency when AI is used in work presented, published, or submitted as one's own, and employees must disclose AI assistance in professional publications, presentations, or products created at ATU or with ATU-licensed materials. The AI principles also require users to verify key facts, sources, quotations, and citations when AI is used for research-related writing or interpretation.",
