        "domain": "Academic Integrity",
        "summary": "In the CT-CCNP nursing program, citations are required for written assignments to acknowledge sources and avoid plagiarism. AI disclosure is not universally mandated in the provided texts, but nursing faculty may require disclosure of AI use. The faculty handbook also states that undisclosed use of generative AI to complete classwork is academic dishonesty.",
