        "evidence": "Inputting any real patient information into AI platforms is a HIPAA violation and strictly prohibited.\nThis option requires that faculty remove personally identifiable information and only faculty receive the originality report.\nFaculty who are also associated with colleges or universities outside the CSCU system are not allowed to upload CSCU student work to a plagiarism detection service provided by that college, nor use our detection service to assess the work of a student not registered for a CSCU‐contracted course.",
