        "evidence": "As artificial intelligence continues to reshape industries, economies, and societies, AIU commits to make AI literacy a core university competency for all students, regardless of discipline. This strategic initiative reinforces AIU’s mission to equip graduates with future-ready skills that are immediately relevant in a rapidly evolving global workforce.\n\nThe initiative integrates AI literacy into academic programs through interdisciplinary coursework, hands-on learning experiences, and applied projects aligned with real-world use cases.\n\nAIU’s approach emphasizes responsible and ethical AI use, ensuring graduates understand not only what AI can do, but also what it should do.\n\nAtlantic International University (AIU) proudly announces the integration of Dall-E as its latest addition to the university’s virtual campus.\n\nBuilding upon the success of the initial integration of ChatGPT, AIU continues to spearhead the transformation of education by incorporating cutting-edge AI technologies into its virtual campus.\n\nIn a decisive step toward reshaping higher education, AIU has introduced the AI Course Builder Assistant, a powerful tool designed to give students unprecedented control over what and how they learn.",
