        "evidence": "* Know when AI tools are permissible and how to properly cite them.\n* How Do I Cite Artificial Intelligence?\n* How to cite ChatGPT (APA style)\nIt is strongly recommended that faculty clearly communicate their expectations about students’ use of AI in their course and/or specific assignments.",
        "sourceUrls": ["https://www.bsu.edu/about/administrativeoffices/information-technology/services/ai-initiatives/academic-integrity", "https://www.bsu.edu/about/administrativeoffices/vice-provost/faculty-services/syllabus-resources"],
