        "evidence": "Barry University embraces the responsible use of generative artificial intelligence (GenAI) to drive innovation across academics, operations, research, and student services.\nBarry University is ready to lead the way in Artificial Intelligence (AI). Through the AI Center @ Barry University, we are embedding AI across every program – empowering our students to explore, create, and push the boundaries of intelligence as we know it.\nAt Barry University, we believe that preparing students for an AI-driven world begins in the classroom. That’s why the AI Center, in collaboration with Center for Excellence in Teaching and Learning (CETL), is committed to integrating artificial intelligence across the curriculum, empowering both faculty and students to engage, embrace innovation and explore the technologies shaping our future.\nBrought to you by the Barry AI Enablement Office to help faculty and staff personalize AI tools for faster, safer work.\nOnly use AI tools that have been vetted and explicitly approved by the Barry University ISO.",
