        "evidence": "It is also highly proficient in STEM tasks like writing and debugging code and solving complex math equations.\n\nClaude can answer prompts conversationally for anything you need assistance with, including coding, math, writing, research, and more.\n\nGitHub Copilot (https://github.com/features/copilot):This tool is an AI code generator that can help you write code by suggesting code based on what you’ already written.\n\nIndividual classes and instructors will define their specific expectations regarding AI use, including whether it is permitted, the rationale for its use or restriction, and the consequences of inappropriate use.",
