        "evidence": "Individual classes and instructors will define their specific expectations regarding AI use, including whether it is permitted, the rationale for its use or restriction, and the consequences of inappropriate use. Students are responsible for reviewing and clarifying their instructor’s AI policy.\n\nThe ultimate goal of this workshop is for faculty to individually create policies on AI and academic integrity that are discipline-specific and can be added to course syllabi.",
